Tu Mila To Haina Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie De De Pyaar De sung by Arijit Singh.

Strumming Pattern: D DU D DU

[Gm] [Eb] [F]

[Bb]Maine khwabon [Gm]mein tumhara,        [C]noor [F]dekha hai
[Bb]Dil ne bhi tum [Gm]ko kahin toh,        za [Eb]roor [F]dekha [Bb]hai
[Gm]Main roz tera [Eb]chehra sunehra,        [Bb]Aankhon mein leke ja [F]gaa
[Gm]Kya jaanta tha, [Eb]tu bhi tha mera,        [Bb]Ab jo mila toh la [F]gaa

[Bb]Der se hi [Gm]sahi magar tu [Eb]mila,        [F]Mila toh hai na
[Bb]Dheere dheere [Gm]sahi magar faas [Eb]la,        [F]Mita toh hai na

[Bb]Der se hi [Gm]sahi magar tu [Eb]mila,        [F]Mila to haina
[Bb]Dheere dheere [Gm]sahi magar faas [Eb]la,        [F]Mita toh hai na

<!-- Post Middle -->

[Bb]Tujhse kisi bhi [Gm]bahaane,        [Eb]Main roz milta [Bb]rahoon
[Gm]Khudko bhi main jaan [Eb]loonga,        [Cm]Jo main tujhe jaan [F]loon

[Gm]Tu jo dikhaaye, [Eb]dekhe nigaahein,        [Bb]Tu jo sunaaye, [F]sunoon
[Gm]Saanson ki hai [Eb]kise zaroorat,        [Bb]Tere bharose [F]jiyun

[Bb]Der se hi [Gm]sahi magar tu [Eb]mila,        [F]Mila to haina
[Bb]Dheere dheere [Gm]sahi magar faas [Eb]la,        [F]Mita toh haina

[Bb]Der se hi [Gm]sahi magar tu [Eb]mila,        Mi [F]la to hai na
[Bb]Dheere dheere sa [Gm]hi magar faas [Eb]la,        [F]Mita toh haina [Gm]o o
[Eb]o o [F]o o o
